			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/716-madonna-truth-or-dare-blu-ray-out-now.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>The Blu-Ray of iconic <a href="http://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B00755646W/ref=as_li_ss_tl?ie=UTF8&amp;tag=drownmadon-20&amp;linkCode=as2&amp;camp=1789&amp;creative=390957&amp;creativeASIN=B00755646W" title="Madonna Truth or Dare Blu Ray">Madonna's Truth or Dare</a> documentary is finally available.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>There is a great deal now at Amazon: only $ 9.99 (save $ 5.00)!! <a href="http://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B00755646W/ref=as_li_ss_tl?ie=UTF8&amp;tag=drownmadon-20&amp;linkCode=as2&amp;camp=1789&amp;creative=390957&amp;creativeASIN=B00755646W" title="Madonna Truth or Dare Blu Ray">Buy it now</a>... be fast!</p>
<p> </p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B00755646W/ref=as_li_ss_tl?ie=UTF8&amp;tag=drownmadon-20&amp;linkCode=as2&amp;camp=1789&amp;creative=390957&amp;creativeASIN=B00755646W" title="Madonna Truth or Dare Blu Ray"><img src="http://drownedmadonna.com/img/truth-or-dare.png" border="0" alt="Madonna Truth or Dare Blu Ray" width="403" height="500" style="border: 0;" /></a></p></div>]]></description>
