		<item>
			<title>Fringe! Film Festival: In Bed With Madonna screening &amp; After Party</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/700-fringe-film-festival-in-bed-with-madonna-screening-after-party.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/700-fringe-film-festival-in-bed-with-madonna-screening-after-party.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedImage"><img src="http://drownedmadonna.com//media/k2/items/cache/1c50d52dbe9254e500a5390a4a3fecb7_S.jpg" alt="Fringe! Film Festival: In Bed With Madonna screening & After Party" /></div><div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p><strong>FRINGE! FILM FEST</strong> in London are putting together a late night screening of <strong>IN BED WITH MADONNA</strong> as well as an after party at DALSTON SUPERSTORE in collaboration with HOT BOY DANCING SPOT and <a href="http://voguingforfringe.eventbrite.com/" target="_blank">vogueing classes</a>.<br /><br /> <a href="http://fringefilmfest.com/films2012/in-bed-with-madonna" target="_blank"></a></p>
<p><a href="http://fringefilmfest.com/films2012/in-bed-with-madonna" target="_blank">Click here</a> to find out more and the screening, and <a href="http://fringefilmfest.com/arteventsandparties/hot-madonna-dancing-spot" target="_blank">here</a> for the after party.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Find out more on the Fringe! Film Festival: <a href="http://fringefilmfest.com/" target="_blank">http://fringefilmfest.com</a>.</p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Movies</category>
			<pubDate>Tue, 27 Mar 2012 13:13:30 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Madonna did not perform. She just introduced the AVICII Remix of Girl Gone Wild.</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/689-madonna-did-not-perform-she-just-introduced-the-avicii-remix-of-girl-gone-wild.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/689-madonna-did-not-perform-she-just-introduced-the-avicii-remix-of-girl-gone-wild.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>UPDATE - <strong>Madonna</strong> did not perform at the <strong>UMF MIAMI 2012</strong> as reported by media.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><strong>Madonna</strong> just went on stage to introduce the <strong>AVICII remix</strong> of her new single, <strong>Girl Gone Wild</strong>.</p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Movies</category>
			<pubDate>Sun, 25 Mar 2012 03:41:35 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Madonna's W.E. won 2 Cue Awards</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/657-madonnas-we-won-2-cue-awards.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/657-madonnas-we-won-2-cue-awards.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>BREAKING NEWS - <strong>Madonna's W.E.</strong> won two <strong>Cue Awards</strong>: Best Dramatic Score and Best Cue on Soundtrack. <a href="http://www.tracksounds.com/specialfeatures/soundcast/index.htm">Click here</a> for the soundcast.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Composer <strong>Abel Korzeniowski</strong> is very grateful for all your support and votes. "Dear Friends, the amount of support I've been receiving from you again and again is overwhelming. Thank you all," he tweeted.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><a href="http://drownedmadonna.com/component/k2/item/354-exclusive-interview-with-abel-korzeniowski-about-madonna-we-and-more.html">Click here</a> to listen to our exclusive and intimate interview with <strong>Abel Korzeniowski</strong>.</p>
<p> </p>
<p> </p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Movies</category>
			<pubDate>Mon, 12 Mar 2012 23:48:57 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Cue Awards: Madonna's W.E. is nominated. Vote now!</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/614-cue-awards-madonnas-we-is-nominated-vote-now.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/614-cue-awards-madonnas-we-is-nominated-vote-now.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p><span style="color: #000000; font-family: 'lucida grande',tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 16px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; display: inline ! important; float: none;">‎</span><strong>Madonna's W.E</strong>. nominated for Best Soundtrack, Best Cue, Best Dramatic Score.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>There are only 4 days left to vote for <strong>Cue Awards</strong>!  <a href="http://bit.ly/zaKCLJ" target="_blank">Vote now</a> and spread the word.</p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Movies</category>
			<pubDate>Tue, 28 Feb 2012 21:08:25 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Arianne Phillips won a Costume Designers Guild Award for Madonna's W.E.</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/599-arianne-phillips-won-a-costume-designers-guild-award-for-madonnas-we.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/599-arianne-phillips-won-a-costume-designers-guild-award-for-madonnas-we.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>
<p><strong>Arianne Phillips</strong> won a <strong>Costume Designers Guild Award</strong> for EXCELLENCE IN PERIOD FILM for <strong>Madonna</strong>'s <strong>W.E.</strong></p>
<p> </p>
<p>The winners were announced last night at the Beverly  Hilton Hotel. The event was hosted by actress, Jane Lynch. The Guild  handed out competitive awards for costume design excellence in seven  categories including films, television and commercials.</p>
</p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Movies</category>
			<pubDate>Wed, 22 Feb 2012 16:01:14 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Who joined Madonna at the after party of the New York's Premiere of W.E.</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/469-who-joined-madonna-at-the-after-party-of-the-new-yorks-premiere-of-we.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/469-who-joined-madonna-at-the-after-party-of-the-new-yorks-premiere-of-we.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>Last Monday, after the premiere of <strong>W.E.</strong>, <strong>Madonna</strong> hit up the Top of the Standard for the Cinema  Society bash, which turned into a late-night dance-off that had <strong>Madonna</strong> on  the floor with her dancers and boyfriend <strong>Brahim Zaibat </strong>until 2 a.m.</p>
<p>According to The New York Post, among those toasting <strong>Madonna</strong> at the Forevermark bash were <strong>Ewan McGregor</strong>, <strong>Julia Stiles</strong>, <strong>Lou Reed,</strong> <strong>Jerry Seinfeld</strong>, <strong>Martha Stewart</strong>, <strong>Helena Christensen</strong>, <strong>Donna Karan</strong>, <strong>Diane von Furstenberg</strong>, <strong>Ivanka Trump</strong>, <strong>Patti Smith </strong>and <strong>Eve</strong>.</p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Movies</category>
			<pubDate>Wed, 25 Jan 2012 13:50:05 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>An Oscar Nomination for Madonna's W.E.: Arianne Phillips nominated for Costume Design</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/464-an-oscar-nomination-for-madonnas-we-arianne-phillips-nominated-for-costume-design.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/464-an-oscar-nomination-for-madonnas-we-arianne-phillips-nominated-for-costume-design.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>The 2012 Oscars Nominations has been finally announced a few minutes ago. Madonna's W.E. has got a nomination for Costume Design. Arianne Phillips is nominated along with Lisy Christl, Mark Bridges, Sandy Powell and Michael O’Connor.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>We hoped for a nomination for Abel Korzeniowski for the Original Score as well. Anyway Madonna has got what she really wished for. Congratulation to our Queen!</p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Movies</category>
			<pubDate>Tue, 24 Jan 2012 13:49:45 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Madonna has fingers crossed for an Oscar nomination for W.E. Nominees to be announced today</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/463-madonna-has-fingers-crossed-for-an-oscar-nomination-for-we-nominees-to-be-announced-today.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/463-madonna-has-fingers-crossed-for-an-oscar-nomination-for-we-nominees-to-be-announced-today.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p><span class="gs-main-content">
<p><strong>Madonna</strong> won a Golden Globe for Best Song with Masterpiece and now she has her "fingers crossed" for an Oscar nomination for <strong>W.E.</strong> And DrownedMadonna.com as well!</p>
<p>"Well, the Oscars, the nominations are coming  out, and fingers crossed, I hope my movie gets nominated for something," <strong>Madonna</strong> told <strong>MTV News</strong>. "I  would be really grateful if it did, but if it doesn't, I got the Super  Bowl - keep on going."</p>
<p> </p>
<p>The <strong>Oscar nominations</strong> are due out later today. Fingers crossed!</p>
</span></p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Movies</category>
			<pubDate>Tue, 24 Jan 2012 11:22:42 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
